{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Medieval Shop Simulator&quot;</strong> is a cozy first-person simulation where every aspect of running a medieval store comes to life \u2014 from stocking shelves with potions, herbs, and swords to selling them for coin and upgrading your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/shopmanagement.png?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Design and furnish thy humble shop</strong>, balancing both function and form. Choose where to lay thy wares, arrange thy aisles with care, and craft a welcoming space where townsfolk may browse with ease and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/shop_management.gif?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/StockShelves.png?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procure stock through thy trusty ledger or trade parchment</strong>. Unpack barrels and crates, store thy goods wisely in the backroom, and display them upon shelves, in cool cellars, or among iceboxes for those goods that perish quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/supply_goods.gif?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/Cashier.png?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tend the counter with diligence</strong>. Weigh items, tally sums, and accept payment in coin or noble promissory notes. Ensure each patron leaves with pouch lighter, heart glad, and arms full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/cashier.gif?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/FreeCommerce.png?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heed the ever-changing market winds</strong>. Purchase goods when prices are fair, and set thy own, balancing thy coinlust with the goodwill of the people. A shrewd merchant knoweth when to hold and when to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/freemarket.gif?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/grow.png?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reinvest thy hard-earned silver wisely</strong>. Expand thy shop\u2019s walls, lay finer stone and timber, and ever adapt thy wares to match the needs of commoners, knights, and nobles alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/grow.gif?t=1747964478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Medieval Shop Simulator</strong>, each choice thou makest weaveth thy path \u2014 from rustic stallkeeper to famed master of trade. Will thy name echo through the town square as the finest merchant of the realm?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753630?t=1747964478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/df3b2848f459abf40b533a597d77ccbe17a30692/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747964478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/a49009703a1325295eb38c0685647c12b5e45626/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747964478","capsule_imagev5"